        "id": 229388,
        "name": "ErekLich",
        "username": "ErekLich",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/f6c823/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-01-06T18:18:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually, I'd argue that you can't.&nbsp; The chart and forms are all specifically attached to the Make Minion ability; they're not an Inherent thing.&nbsp; Similarly, if you took the Summon Ally from Nature, which represents summoning an animal, how could you apply upgrades to that?&nbsp; It makes no sense.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:04:07.414Z",
