        "raw": "<p>Actually, I'd argue that you can't.&nbsp; The chart and forms are all specifically attached to the Make Minion ability; they're not an Inherent thing.&nbsp; Similarly, if you took the Summon Ally from Nature, which represents summoning an animal, how could you apply upgrades to that?&nbsp; It makes no sense.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
