      {
        "id": 229389,
        "name": "aramis",
        "username": "aramis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/aramis/{size}/1871_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-01-06T20:22:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My instinctive reaction is that sure, you can set it up for that... but if you do, that's the only kind of minion it summons. So if you're a Ghostmaster, all you're summoning is Ghosts; if you're a robot maker, nought but bots.</p>\n<p>Then again, I come from a background of running Champions,&nbsp; in which you buy the effect, then skin it to fit. EG:&nbsp; If you're the&nbsp;&nbsp;time-displaced starship captain Greenshirt, it's a beamdown of security goons in red velour... just in the nick of time.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:04:07.486Z",
